---
const pageTitle = "Singapore Music Lessons Fee Benchmark 2026";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{pageTitle}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Comprehensive benchmark index detailing private music tuition rates, school package costs, and ABRSM exam fees in Singapore." />
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; color: #1a1a1a; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    th, td { border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 12px; text-align: left; }
    th { background-color: #f8fafc; font-weight: 600; }
    h1 { font-size: 2rem; color: #0f172a; }
    .meta-box { background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header style="margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px;">
    <strong>🇸🇬 Singapore Music Education Data Hub</strong>
  </header>
  <main>
    <h1>Singapore Music Lessons Fee Benchmark Directory</h1>
    <div class="meta-box">
      <strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> Private home music lessons in Singapore average <strong>$40 to $120 per hour</strong>, depending on instructor qualification (ATCL/LTCL) and grade level.
    </div>

    <h2>Monthly Music Lesson Rates (4x Weekly Sessions)</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Instrument</th>
          <th>Format</th>
          <th>Beginner (Monthly)</th>
          <th>Intermediate (Grades 1–5)</th>
          <th>Advanced (Grades 6–8)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Piano (Classical)</strong></td>
          <td>Home Private / School</td>
          <td>$130 – $190 SGD</td>
          <td>$160 – $260 SGD</td>
          <td>$290 – $450+ SGD</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Violin</strong></td>
          <td>Studio / Home Private</td>
          <td>$165 – $220 SGD</td>
          <td>$200 – $350 SGD</td>
          <td>$320 – $480+ SGD</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Guitar</strong></td>
          <td>Private / Small Group</td>
          <td>$140 – $200 SGD</td>
          <td>$180 – $260 SGD</td>
          <td>$280 – $400 SGD</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
